; We only ever use modbus-serial's TCP client (see lib/ModbusClient.js).
; Its optional "serialport" dependency pulls in a large tree of native
; (.node) bindings for RTU/serial support that we never use, and which have
; caused "Missing File" errors when installing on Homey Pro. modbus-serial
; wraps that require() in try/catch, so it works fine without it - omit
; optional deps entirely so a plain `npm install` never pulls it in.
omit=optional
